shores of Kasai. Because no one could fix their ship, the Japanese Government decided to bestow upon them the designation \"DearS\" and make them into Japanese citizens.  One morning, a truck carrying a capsule that housed one of the aliens ends up dropping it into the riverbank, releasing her from her confinement. She is eventually found by a high school student named Takeya Ikuhara, who saves her, despite being extremely distrustful of their race and wanting nothing to do with them. Upon being named Ren, she imprints upon him as her \"Master\" and serves as his personal \"Slave,\" leaving him with a \"DearS\" who wants to remain with him no matter what."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"一年前、宇宙人の一団を乗せた宇宙船が東京湾に漂着した。帰る術を持たない彼らは正式に日本の市民権を得て、「親愛なる友達」という意味を込め\"DearS（ディアーズ）\"という通称を与えられる。そんな中、高校生の武哉はある日偶然ディアーズの少女に出会う。なりゆきでその少女・レンと同居することになった武哉だが、それをきっかけに武哉の周囲はどんどん賑やかになっていくのだった……。","tagline":"これって不純異星交遊!?"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t6BZXU61cwBX9779JIRyM9H1vpJ.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t6BZXU61cwBX9779JIRyM9H1vpJ.png","language":"xx","width":556,"height":298}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rqquMDIzWC1oAQ6XvKKF8OzBx8K.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rqquMDIzWC1oAQ6XvKKF8OzBx8K.jpg","language":"en","width":640,"height":960},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lKydkmuKjmQpNKrOzwMUSVmCgPq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lKydkmuKjmQpNKrOzwMUSVmCgPq.jpg","language":"ja","width":640,"height":960},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pc1sNvlKA4BvKNGk6hYzRUV0xWY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pc1sNvlKA4BvKNGk6hYzRUV0xWY.jpg","language":"xx","width":600,"height":856}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xtMhBn1RTKR7cYjAVZXvuZ88A4O.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xtMhBn1RTKR7cYjAVZXvuZ88A4O.jpg","language":"x